{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43170","headline":"宿香山阁 · 贾彦璋","name":"宿香山阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暝望香山阁，梯云宿半空。\n轩窗闭潮海，枕席拂烟虹。\n朱网防栖鸽，纱灯护夕虫。\n一闻鸡唱晓，已见日曈曈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾彦璋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43170.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43170","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}